Key Tasks. - The key tasks of the Commission shall be the following:
1. Undertake a study of the causes, costs and actions to be taken in the wake of
Typhoons Ondoy, Pepeng and Frank;
2. Undertake the rehabilitation plan for wrecked infrastructure and other
priorities;
3. Raise funds, especially grants, to fund reconstruction;
4. Prioritize programs;
5. Oversea implementation;
6. Serve as clearing house for international assistance implemented by the
donors themselves using the cluster approach;
POMA Holosram r 50952

7. Request the United Nations and the World Bank to coordinate an
international pledging session.
